---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/hz/misc.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="信号丢失 · 404" description="页面不存在或已被移出当前轨道。" page="404">
  <section class="hz-wrap hz-404" aria-labelledby="hz-404-title">
    <div class="hz-404__ring" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="hz-404__code">404</span>
    </div>
    <p class="hz-mono" style="color:var(--hz-hot-ink)">SIGNAL LOST // BEYOND EVENT HORIZON · <span lang="ja">信号消失</span></p>
    <h1 id="hz-404-title" class="hz-404__title">信号越过视界</h1>
    <p class="hz-404__deck">请求的路径没有返回任何观测记录，可能已被删除或迁往新的编目坐标。</p>
    <div class="hz-404__actions">
      <a class="hz-btn hz-btn--hot" href="/">返回首页 →</a>
      <a class="hz-btn" href="/blog/">浏览全部文章 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
